 "remarks": "Welcome to River Terrace! Discover the perfect blend of space, comfort, and convenience in this beautifully maintained 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom condo offering 1,325 square feet of living space. Ideally located near Scalzi Park, featuring state-of-the-art tennis and pickleball courts, as well as golf courses, shopping, and restaurants, this inviting home offers a wonderful combination of comfort and accessibility.  The open-concept living and dining area features sliding glass doors that lead to a spacious deck overlooking the peaceful, landscaped courtyard. The kitchen is appointed with granite countertops, providing an attractive and functional space for everyday living and entertaining. The primary bedroom features a walk-in closet, while the generously sized second bedroom offers flexibility for guests, a home office, or additional living needs. A full hall bathroom conveniently serves both bedrooms.  Additional highlights include an in-unit washer and dryer, an intercom system, and ample storage, two exterior storage sheds as well as shared basement storage. Parking is easy with one reserved carport space plus additional parking in unassigned \"guest\" spaces.  Conveniently located just minutes from vibrant downtown Stamford, with quick access to Greenwich, this second-floor condo offers an appealing combination of space, convenience, and location. Don't delay: Schedule your private tour today! Please shut door quickly as resident indoor cat might try to escape! :)",
